{"catalog": {"input": {"label": "Entr\u00e9e LTI", "category": "G\u00e9n\u00e9rateurs", "inputs": 0, "parameters": {}, "equation": "x[n]", "description": "Entr\u00e9e externe pour mesurer un syst\u00e8me LTI. Impulsion unit\u00e9 en simulation autonome.", "lti": true}, "oscillator": {"label": "Sinus", "category": "G\u00e9n\u00e9rateurs", "inputs": 0, "parameters": {"frequency": {"default": 440, "minimum": 1, "maximum": 47000, "unit": "Hz", "label": "Fr\u00e9quence"}, "amplitude": {"default": 0.3, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 4, "unit": "", "label": "Amplitude"}, "phase": {"default": 0, "minimum": -3.141592653589793, "maximum": 3.141592653589793, "unit": "rad", "label": "Phase"}}, "equation": "x(t) = A sin(2\u03c0ft + \u03c6)", "description": "Oscillateur sinuso\u00efdal d\u00e9terministe. Fr\u00e9quence strictement inf\u00e9rieure \u00e0 Nyquist.", "lti": false}, "modal": {"label": "Mode amorti", "category": "Physique", "inputs": 0, "parameters": {"frequency": {"default": 440, "minimum": 1, "maximum": 47000, "unit": "Hz", "label": "Fr\u00e9quence"}, "amplitude": {"default": 0.3, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 4, "unit": "", "label": "Amplitude"}, "phase": {"default": 0, "minimum": -3.141592653589793, "maximum": 3.141592653589793, "unit": "rad", "label": "Phase"}, "tau": {"default": 1, "minimum": 0.005, "maximum": 30, "unit": "s", "label": "D\u00e9croissance \u03c4"}, "attack": {"default": 0.005, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 5, "unit": "s", "label": "Attaque"}, "onset": {"default": 0, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 60, "unit": "s", "label": "D\u00e9but"}}, "equation": "x(t) = A e^(\u2212u/\u03c4)(1\u2212e^(\u2212u/a)) sin(2\u03c0fu+\u03c6), u=t\u2212t\u2080 \u2265 0", "description": "Mode oscillatoire amorti avec mise en vibration progressive. Apr\u00e8s attaque : q\u2033 + 2q\u2032/\u03c4 + ((2\u03c0f)\u00b2 + 1/\u03c4\u00b2)q = 0. La phase et l\u2019amplitude d\u00e9crivent les conditions initiales ; aucune identification unique de masse/raideur.", "lti": false}, "noise": {"label": "Bruit blanc", "category": "G\u00e9n\u00e9rateurs", "inputs": 0, "parameters": {"amplitude": {"default": 0.3, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 4, "unit": "", "label": "Amplitude"}, "seed": {"default": 42, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1000000, "unit": "", "label": "Graine"}}, "equation": "x[n] = A \u03be[n], \u03be ~ N(0,1)", "description": "Bruit gaussien reproductible \u00e0 graine fix\u00e9e. Amplitude = \u00e9cart-type.", "lti": false}, "impulse": {"label": "Impulsion", "category": "G\u00e9n\u00e9rateurs", "inputs": 0, "parameters": {"amplitude": {"default": 0.3, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 4, "unit": "", "label": "Amplitude"}}, "equation": "x[n] = A \u03b4[n]", "description": "Impulsion discr\u00e8te unit\u00e9, pas une distribution de Dirac continue.", "lti": false}, "gain": {"label": "Gain", "category": "Math\u00e9matiques", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"gain": {"default": 1, "minimum": -4, "maximum": 4, "unit": "\u00d7", "label": "Gain"}}, "equation": "H(z) = g", "description": "Gain lin\u00e9aire constant.", "lti": true}, "sum": {"label": "Somme", "category": "Math\u00e9matiques", "inputs": -1, "parameters": {}, "equation": "y[n] = \u03a3 x\u1d62[n]", "description": "Somme sans normalisation implicite.", "lti": true}, "multiply": {"label": "Produit / VCA", "category": "Dynamique", "inputs": 2, "parameters": {}, "equation": "y[n] = x\u2081[n] x\u2082[n]", "description": "Produit de deux signaux. Pas de fonction de transfert LTI globale.", "lti": false}, "lowpass": {"label": "Passe-bas", "category": "Filtres", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"fc": {"default": 3500, "minimum": 5, "maximum": 47000, "unit": "Hz", "label": "Fr\u00e9quence caract\u00e9ristique"}, "q": {"default": 0.70710678, "minimum": 0.1, "maximum": 40, "unit": "", "label": "Facteur Q"}}, "equation": "H(s) = \u03a9\u00b2 / (s\u00b2 + \u03a9s/Q + \u03a9\u00b2)", "description": "Second ordre. Transformation bilin\u00e9aire, \u03a9 = 2fs tan(\u03c0fc/fs). Le Bode num\u00e9rique tient compte du pr\u00e9-gauchissement.", "lti": true}, "highpass": {"label": "Passe-haut", "category": "Filtres", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"fc": {"default": 3500, "minimum": 5, "maximum": 47000, "unit": "Hz", "label": "Fr\u00e9quence caract\u00e9ristique"}, "q": {"default": 0.70710678, "minimum": 0.1, "maximum": 40, "unit": "", "label": "Facteur Q"}}, "equation": "H(s) = s\u00b2 / (s\u00b2 + \u03a9s/Q + \u03a9\u00b2)", "description": "Second ordre. Transformation bilin\u00e9aire pr\u00e9-gauchie \u00e0 fc.", "lti": true}, "bandpass": {"label": "Passe-bande", "category": "Filtres", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"fc": {"default": 3500, "minimum": 5, "maximum": 47000, "unit": "Hz", "label": "Fr\u00e9quence caract\u00e9ristique"}, "q": {"default": 0.70710678, "minimum": 0.1, "maximum": 40, "unit": "", "label": "Facteur Q"}}, "equation": "H(s) = (\u03a9/Q)s / (s\u00b2 + \u03a9s/Q + \u03a9\u00b2)", "description": "Gain unit\u00e9 \u00e0 fc. Transformation bilin\u00e9aire pr\u00e9-gauchie.", "lti": true}, "notch": {"label": "Coupe-bande", "category": "Filtres", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"fc": {"default": 3500, "minimum": 5, "maximum": 47000, "unit": "Hz", "label": "Fr\u00e9quence caract\u00e9ristique"}, "q": {"default": 0.70710678, "minimum": 0.1, "maximum": 40, "unit": "", "label": "Facteur Q"}}, "equation": "H(s) = (s\u00b2+\u03a9\u00b2) / (s\u00b2 + \u03a9s/Q + \u03a9\u00b2)", "description": "Z\u00e9ro \u00e0 fc. Transformation bilin\u00e9aire pr\u00e9-gauchie.", "lti": true}, "resonator": {"label": "R\u00e9sonateur", "category": "Physique", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"frequency": {"default": 440, "minimum": 1, "maximum": 47000, "unit": "Hz", "label": "Fr\u00e9quence"}, "tau": {"default": 1, "minimum": 0.005, "maximum": 30, "unit": "s", "label": "D\u00e9croissance \u03c4"}}, "equation": "H(z) = (1\u2212r) / (1\u22122r cos(\u03b8)z\u207b\u00b9+r\u00b2z\u207b\u00b2)", "description": "P\u00f4les r exp(\u00b1j\u03b8), r=exp(\u22121/(fs\u03c4)), \u03b8=2\u03c0f/fs. R\u00e9sonateur num\u00e9rique stable ; amplitude non normalis\u00e9e \u00e0 la r\u00e9sonance.", "lti": true}, "delay": {"label": "D\u00e9lai", "category": "Math\u00e9matiques", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"seconds": {"default": 0.01, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 2, "unit": "s", "label": "Retard"}}, "equation": "H(z) = z\u207b\u1d3a, N = round(fs T)", "description": "Retard entier, arrondi \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9chantillon le plus proche. Les boucles ne sont pas prises en charge.", "lti": true}, "envelope": {"label": "Enveloppe exponentielle", "category": "Dynamique", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"attack": {"default": 0.005, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 5, "unit": "s", "label": "Attaque"}, "tau": {"default": 1, "minimum": 0.005, "maximum": 30, "unit": "s", "label": "D\u00e9croissance \u03c4"}, "onset": {"default": 0, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 60, "unit": "s", "label": "D\u00e9but"}}, "equation": "y(t) = x(t)(1\u2212exp(\u2212u/a))exp(\u2212u/\u03c4), u=t\u2212t\u2080 \u2265 0", "description": "Multiplication temporelle. Lin\u00e9aire mais non invariant dans le temps ; pas de Bode LTI.", "lti": false}, "adsr": {"label": "ADSR", "category": "Dynamique", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"attack": {"default": 0.01, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 5, "unit": "s", "label": "Attaque"}, "decay": {"default": 0.2, "minimum": 0.001, "maximum": 10, "unit": "s", "label": "Decay"}, "sustain": {"default": 0.5, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1, "unit": "\u00d7", "label": "Sustain"}, "gate": {"default": 1, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 60, "unit": "s", "label": "Dur\u00e9e de note"}, "release": {"default": 0.4, "minimum": 0.001, "maximum": 10, "unit": "s", "label": "Release"}}, "equation": "y(t) = x(t) A_ADSR(t)", "description": "Segments lin\u00e9aires ; le rel\u00e2chement part du niveau r\u00e9ellement atteint \u00e0 la fin du gate. Le gate ne peut pas \u00eatre d\u00e9duit univoquement d\u2019un WAV.", "lti": false}, "saturation": {"label": "Saturation douce", "category": "Non lin\u00e9aire", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"drive": {"default": 1, "minimum": 0.01, "maximum": 20, "unit": "\u00d7", "label": "Drive"}}, "equation": "y[n] = tanh(d x[n])", "description": "Non-lin\u00e9arit\u00e9 statique, sans sur\u00e9chantillonnage : des harmoniques peuvent se replier. Aucun Bode LTI.", "lti": false}, "asymmetric_saturation": {"label": "Saturation asym\u00e9trique \u00d74", "category": "Non lin\u00e9aire", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"drive": {"default": 4, "minimum": 0.1, "maximum": 60, "unit": "\u00d7", "label": "Drive"}, "bias": {"default": 0.5, "minimum": -3, "maximum": 3, "unit": "", "label": "Asym\u00e9trie"}, "mix": {"default": 1, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1, "unit": "", "label": "M\u00e9lange"}, "level": {"default": 0.2, "minimum": 0, "maximum": 4, "unit": "\u00d7", "label": "Niveau"}}, "equation": "y = g [(1\u2212m)x + m(tanh(dx+b)\u2212tanh(b))], sur\u00e9chantillonnage \u00d74", "description": "Une seule non-lin\u00e9arit\u00e9, sans oscillateur cach\u00e9. L\u2019asym\u00e9trie permet des harmoniques paires. Interpolation et d\u00e9cimation polyphas\u00e9es \u00d74 ; filtrage anti-repliement, sans garantie de suppression totale. Niveau explicite.", "lti": false}, "peak_eq": {"label": "\u00c9galiseur param\u00e9trique", "category": "Filtres", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"fc": {"default": 1500, "minimum": 5, "maximum": 47000, "unit": "Hz", "label": "Fr\u00e9quence centrale"}, "q": {"default": 1, "minimum": 0.1, "maximum": 20, "unit": "", "label": "Facteur Q"}, "db": {"default": 0, "minimum": -30, "maximum": 30, "unit": "dB", "label": "Gain de bande"}}, "equation": "H(s) = (s\u00b2 + A \u03a9 s/Q + \u03a9\u00b2)/(s\u00b2 + \u03a9 s/(A Q) + \u03a9\u00b2), A=10^(G/40)", "description": "Un biquad de correction spectrale, gain G dB \u00e0 fc, unit\u00e9 \u00e0 DC et Nyquist. Transformation bilin\u00e9aire pr\u00e9-gauchie.", "lti": true}, "lowpass1": {"label": "Passe-bas 6 dB/oct", "category": "Filtres", "inputs": 1, "parameters": {"fc": {"default": 3500, "minimum": 5, "maximum": 47000, "unit": "Hz", "label": "Fr\u00e9quenc